Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.40,0:02:56.24,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}只需拚盡自己所能
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.53,0:02:59.87,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}心中有你  我便無所不能
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.87,0:03:04.04,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}願心靈永遠強大
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.41,0:03:07.79,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}No Way 愛無需多加修飾
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.79,0:03:13.17,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}Don't Think 愛只需原樣便好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.14,0:02:06.06,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\shad0\bord3\blur4}即使願望無法實現
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.06,0:02:09.69,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\shad0\bord3\blur4}我也會無數遍祈禱
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.69,0:02:13.07,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\shad0\bord3\blur4}如果想要相信某人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.07,0:02:17.24,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\shad0\bord3\blur4}那就相信便是
